Friends&Foes 5.0.4 (mod id friendsandfoes) with Beekeeper Hut 3.0.4 (beekeeperhut) and Flowery Mooblooms 3.0.3 (flowerymooblooms), NeoForge builds for Minecraft 26.1.2, used unmodified as pack dependencies (MOD-FIRST rule: a current 26.1.2 NeoForge build exists, so no port and no new Diaithir jar).
Source: Modrinth project friends-and-foes-forge (BOCJKD49) and the two addon projects friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-forge (K62sN7Sd) and friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-forge (wYtDgIUZ). Author: Faboslav. Code: https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes
