Requires Resourceful Lib 4.0.1 (resourcefullib, MIT; ResourcefulLib-4.0.1.jar, sha256 4ccedbc89c82a73132eb3a83a5dd3b1923c62d1373aa5cd707780dc5160e9e15). YACL is an optional client-side dependency and is already in the pack.
Family decision: PLAN_TO_V1 and the consolidation audit do not mention Friends&Foes; its family is the base mod plus two official addons. Mutant Monsters is not part of this family: it is already in the pack and is slated to merge into diaithir-hostile-encounters. The Fabric-only variants (friends-and-foes, polymer) and the Repurposed Structures / CTOV compat packs are not used.
Walkers 8.2 (already patched for Alex's Mobs) ships variants for friendsandfoes mauler, moobloom, tuff_golem and copper_golem. Copper Golem is not a registered entity in 5.0.4 (the vanilla copper golem replaced it), so that one variant is inert; it loads without error.
